=== ISSUE ===
Title: get_tv_game: no-channel call is a 404, and with a channel it returns 10 games

- With no channel, `get_tv_game` calls `GET /api/tv`. That endpoint isn't in the Lichess API spec (https://github.com/lichess-org/api/blob/906d1a6e93ca1ba4b65c9decb3077f2431c6d55a/doc/specs/lichess-api.yaml) and returns 404 live.
- With a channel, it calls `/api/tv/{channel}`. That endpoint exports the channel's recent games, 10 by default (checked live), but the tool description promises "the current TV game".

