Closes #<issue>

- `channel` now defaults to `best` (top rated) instead of calling the nonexistent `/api/tv`.
- Sends `nb=1`, so the tool returns the current game.
- Spec: https://github.com/lichess-org/api/blob/906d1a6e93ca1ba4b65c9decb3077f2431c6d55a/doc/specs/lichess-api.yaml (`/api/tv/{channel}`)

